res←LoadBallot(filename titlerow);data;preferences
  ⍝ Load a CSV file with votes and extract the relevant information
  ⍝
  ⍝ Right arguments:
  ⍝ * filename: a string containing the filename of the ballot CSV.
  ⍝   this is assumed to be located in the `data` folder of this repository.
  ⍝ * titlerow: a string containing the name of the header row that has the voting preferences.
  ⍝
  ⍝ Returns: A Ballot, similarly to what the Ballot function returns

  data←⎕CSV ⍙WS,'/data/',filename
  preferences←1↓data⌷[2]⍨data[1;]⍳⊂titlerow
  ⍝ TBC
